    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Charming Two-Bedroom Bungalow Set on 1.16 Acres of Beautiful Grounds\r\n\r\nA wonderful opportunity to acquire a charming bungalow set in a peaceful rural location, surrounded by approximately 1.16 acres of mature gardens and grounds.\r\n\r\nSituated at Eglington, Barney, Edgeworthstown, Co. Longford, this delightful property offers the perfect combination of comfortable single-storey accommodation, generous outdoor space and a tranquil countryside setting.\r\n\r\nThe property comprises an entrance hall, living room, two bedrooms, bathroom, kitchen/dining room and utility room, together with a garage.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is well suited to those seeking a manageable home in a peaceful location, while the substantial grounds offer enormous appeal for anyone who enjoys gardening, outdoor pursuits or simply having space and privacy around their home.\r\n\r\nA particular feature of this property is the beautiful 1.16-acre garden, which provides an impressive amount of space and privacy. The mature grounds offer plenty of scope for enjoying the outdoors, creating additional garden areas, entertaining or simply relaxing in the peaceful surroundings.\r\n\r\nThe garage provides valuable additional storage and parking, while the overall site offers a wonderful sense of space rarely found with a property of this type.\r\n\r\nLocated just outside Edgeworthstown, the property enjoys a rural setting while remaining within convenient reach of the town and its amenities, including shops, schools, services and transport links.\r\n\r\nWhether you are looking for a peaceful permanent home, a countryside retreat or a property with generous grounds and potential, this attractive bungalow is sure to appeal.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to appreciate the setting, gardens and potential of this lovely property.\r\n\r\nAccommodation:\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall  6.47 mts x 0.97 mts\r\nLiving Room 3.83 mts x 5.00 mts\r\nKitchen/Dining Room 5.73 mts x 4.28 mts\r\nUtility Room 2.24 mts x 1.98 mts\r\nTwo Bedrooms 3.34 mts x 3.34 mts and 2.63 mts x 4.26 mts\r\nBathroom 3.42 mts x 2.20 mts\r\nGarage 4.74 mts x 1.53 mts\r\nApproximately 1.16 acres of gardens and grounds\r\nA rare opportunity to acquire a charming bungalow with substantial grounds in a peaceful location close to Edgeworthstown."
      },
